# Investment Intelligence System (IIS)

## Overview

Investment Intelligence System (IIS) is an AI-assisted decision support system designed for the Iranian capital market.

The primary objective is not to predict the market, but to improve investment decisions through validated data, structured analysis, and disciplined risk management.

---

## Core Principles

- Capital preservation comes before return maximization.
- No investment recommendation without validated data.
- Every conclusion must be explainable.
- Facts must always be separated from forecasts.
- Every analysis should be archived for future evaluation.

---

## Main Data Sources

- TSETMC (Primary market data)
- Codal (Financial statements and disclosures)
- Global Markets
- Gold
- Copper
- Oil
- USD Index
- Reliable macroeconomic indicators

---

## System Modules

- Data Collector
- Validation Engine
- Market Analyzer
- Portfolio Analyzer
- Gold Fund Analyzer
- Decision Engine
- Risk Manager
- Report Generator

---

